# PROJECT: DESIGN AND IMPLEMENTATION OF A COMPUTER HARDWARE DIAGNOSTIC AND MONITORING SYSTEM

## MASTER PROMPT FOR GOOGLE AI STUDIO

Act as a senior software engineer, computer hardware specialist, systems programmer, cybersecurity engineer, product designer and technical product architect.

I want you to design and build a comprehensive Computer Hardware Diagnostic and Monitoring System.

The application should help users inspect their computer specifications, monitor hardware performance, detect potential hardware problems, run diagnostic tests, monitor system health and generate professional diagnostic reports.

This must be a real, functional software product, not simply a collection of attractive dashboard screens.

Build an application that looks and feels like a professional computer diagnostic utility that could be used by computer technicians, IT support professionals, students and ordinary computer users.

Prioritize:
- Accurate hardware information.
- Reliable diagnostic procedures.
- Useful troubleshooting recommendations.
- Real-time system monitoring where supported.
- Professional data visualization.
- Excellent user experience.
- Privacy and security.
- Cross-platform compatibility.

Do not fabricate hardware information or display simulated values as actual readings.

